(END-TO-END RAG SYSTEM REPORT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Task Overview) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This project builds a retrieval augmented generation \(RAG\) system for factual question ) Tj
T*
(answering. The system receives a question, retrieves relevant passages from a public ) Tj
T*
(knowledge resource, and returns a concise answer. The final submitted output is ) Tj
T*
(`system_outputs/system_output_1.txt`, with one generated answer per test question.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Data Creation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Knowledge Resource) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The knowledge resource was collected from public VnExpress RSS feeds and article pages. I ) Tj
T*
(used three feeds to cover several factual domains:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- `giao_duc`: education and university-related news.) Tj
T*
(- `khoa_hoc`: science and research news.) Tj
T*
(- `so_hoa`: digital technology and product news.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The final raw corpus contains 90 public articles and 76,213 words. Each article is stored ) Tj
T*
(with structured metadata and body text:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- source) Tj
T*
(- category) Tj
T*
(- domain) Tj
T*
(- URL) Tj
T*
(- publication date) Tj
T*
(- title) Tj
T*
(- summary) Tj
T*
(- article body) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The raw data is stored in `data/raw/news/corpus_long.txt`. The crawled article records are ) Tj
T*
(stored in `data/news/articles.jsonl`, and summary statistics are stored in ) Tj
T*
(`data/news/metadata.json`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Extraction And Cleaning) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The data collection script is `scripts/prepare_news_rag_data.py`. It reads RSS feeds, ) Tj
T*
(fetches public article pages, extracts title, date, summary, and article paragraphs with ) Tj
T*
(BeautifulSoup, and removes repeated whitespace. The cleaned text is converted into a plain ) Tj
T*
(text corpus. `scripts/build_corpus.py` then chunks the corpus into overlapping word windows ) Tj
T*
(and writes `data/processed/corpus.jsonl`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(QA Annotation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The QA data was generated from article metadata and body content. The question templates use) Tj
T*
( natural article-title references rather than artificial IDs. Example question types ) Tj
T*
(include:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Source/category/domain questions.) Tj
T*
(- URL and publication date questions.) Tj
T*
(- Summary questions.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
