BT
/F1 10 Tf
13 TL
54 744 Td
(- Opening, second, third, ending, and first-words body questions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The final annotated data has 1,000 QA pairs:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- 850 train/development examples in `data/train/`.) Tj
T*
(- 150 test examples in `data/test/`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The answer strings are copied directly from the source article fields or article body. This ) Tj
T*
(makes each reference answer grounded in the public knowledge resource.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Data Quality) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(I validated the generated QA files by checking that every question has a corresponding ) Tj
T*
(answer line and that the source corpus contains the articles referenced by the question ) Tj
T*
(titles. During development, I found that a 50,000-word truncation removed some later ) Tj
T*
(articles while the QA generator still produced questions from all 90 articles. I fixed this ) Tj
T*
(by keeping the full 90-article corpus, then rebuilt the processed corpus, retrieval index, ) Tj
T*
(and system outputs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This was a single-person project, so a formal two-annotator inter-annotator agreement score ) Tj
T*
(was not available. Instead, I performed deterministic consistency checks and manual audits ) Tj
T*
(of sampled QA pairs. The main remaining risk is that automatically generated questions are ) Tj
T*
(less diverse than fully human-written questions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. System Design) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Preprocessing) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(`scripts/build_corpus.py` reads `.txt`, `.html`, and `.pdf` documents, normalizes ) Tj
T*
(whitespace, and chunks text into 900-word windows with 150-word overlap. For the final run, ) Tj
T*
(it produced 102 chunks from the news corpus.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Retrieval) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The retriever uses `sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-mpnet-base-v2` to encode ) Tj
T*
(the corpus chunks and questions. Retrieval is based on cosine similarity. Because the QA ) Tj
T*
(dataset asks questions by article title, I added an exact quoted-title boost during ) Tj
T*
(retrieval. If a question contains a quoted title and a chunk contains that title, the chunk ) Tj
T*
(receives an additional score. This improves grounding and avoids retrieving a semantically ) Tj
T*
(similar but wrong article.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The optional reranker uses `cross-encoder/mmarco-mMiniLMv2-L12-H384-v1`. It is disabled in ) Tj
T*
(the final command with `--no-reranker` to keep the run practical on the local CPU ) Tj
T*
(environment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Answering) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The main system is implemented in `src/rag_system/qa.py`. It uses two answer paths:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. A fast article-field extractor for the generated title-based QA patterns. It reads fields) Tj
T*
( such as source, category, URL, date, summary, and relevant body sentences from the ) Tj
T*
(retrieved article text.) Tj
T*
(2. A fallback extractive QA reader using `letrunglinh/qa_pnc` for questions that do not ) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
