(match the structured patterns.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This keeps the final system grounded in the retrieved documents while still supporting ) Tj
T*
(extractive answering for less structured questions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(I also added a Windows-specific workaround in `src/rag_system/model_cache.py` because ) Tj
T*
(PyTorch import was hanging when Windows WMI platform queries stalled. The workaround patches) Tj
T*
( the platform probes before loading Hugging Face libraries.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Experiments) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(I used exact match, token F1, and answer recall, matching the assignment metrics. The ) Tj
T*
(evaluation script is `scripts/evaluate.py`.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Development Runs) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| System variant | Corpus | Notes | Exact match | F1 | Answer recall |) Tj
T*
(|---|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|) Tj
T*
(| Early dense retrieval + QA | truncated 50,000-word corpus | Some referenced articles were ) Tj
T*
(missing | 0.3600 | 0.4719 | 0.3600 |) Tj
T*
(| Title-aware retrieval + structured extractor | truncated 50,000-word corpus | Better ) Tj
T*
(retrieval, but still missing later articles | 0.6733 | 0.7207 | 0.6800 |) Tj
T*
(| Final system | full 90-article corpus | Full corpus, title-aware retrieval, structured ) Tj
T*
(extractor + QA fallback | 0.9067 | 0.9332 | 0.9133 |) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final Run Commands) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```bash) Tj
T*
(python scripts/build_corpus.py --raw-dir data/raw/news --out data/processed/corpus.jsonl) Tj
T*
(python scripts/build_index.py --corpus data/processed/corpus.jsonl --out ) Tj
T*
(data/processed/index.pkl) Tj
T*
(python scripts/run_rag.py --questions data/test/questions.txt --index ) Tj
T*
(data/processed/index.pkl --out system_outputs/system_output_1.txt --no-reranker) Tj
T*
(python scripts/evaluate.py --predictions system_outputs/system_output_1.txt --references ) Tj
T*
(data/test/reference_answers.txt) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final local evaluation:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(```text) Tj
T*
(exact_match: 0.9067) Tj
T*
(f1: 0.9332) Tj
T*
(answer_recall: 0.9133) Tj
T*
(```) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Analysis) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The final system performs well on metadata questions because the answer fields are ) Tj
T*
(explicitly present in the retrieved article text. It also performs well on opening and ) Tj
T*
(summary questions when the retriever returns the correct title-matched chunk.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Most remaining errors come from body-sentence questions. Long article chunks sometimes ) Tj
T*
(include several articles, so extracting the "ending" or "third information" can select a ) Tj
ET
